# Il Giro di Sant'Orsola: round and through the Policlinico Sant'Orsola-Malpighi in Bologna.
# Down the Viali from Porta San Vitale to Porta Maggiore, out along Via Mazzini, up Via
# Albertoni, along Via Massarenti, then into the hospital: down its eastern drive, along the
# long avenue between the pavilions and out to Via Massarenti again, back to Porta San Vitale.
# tools/osm2track builds sorsola.track from this block and an OpenStreetMap extract.

hazard ambulance
    name Ambulanza
    text Ambulances cross the hospital's avenue on a timetable. Give way.
    model ambulance.glb
    cross Policlinico Sant'Orsola-Malpighi 0.45
    every 7 offset 2
    speed 9
    size 5.2 2.4
    margin 7
    effect bump 1.2
end

track sorsola
    name Il Giro di Sant'Orsola
    text Bologna, between the Viali and the Policlinico: two city gates, the plane trees of
    text Viale Ercolani, the porticoes of Via Mazzini and an avenue through the hospital.
    osm sorsola.track
    laps 3
    route Piazza di Porta San Vitale
    route Viale Giambattista Ercolani
    route Piazza di Porta Maggiore
    route Via Giuseppe Mazzini
    route Via Pietro Albertoni
    route Via Giuseppe Massarenti
    # Into the hospital at its gate on Via Massarenti, down to the long avenue, west along
    # it to the roundabout and north again to Via Massarenti.
    route ways 617896269 617896271 617896272 301242138 972250315 968243713 396802845 617896281 617896282 617896286
    route Via Giuseppe Massarenti
    start Viale Giambattista Ercolani 0.3
    widen 1.25
    min-width 8.5
    verge 5
    scenery 60
    landmark gate Porta San Vitale
    landmark gate Porta Maggiore
    dress tree tree_oak.glb every 13 offset 2 scale 6.5 9 face random along Viale Giambattista Ercolani
    dress tree tree_oak.glb every 22 offset 2.5 scale 6 8.5 face random along Policlinico Sant'Orsola-Malpighi
    dress lamp lightPostModern.glb every 34 offset 0.6 side right scale 8 along Via Giuseppe Mazzini
    dress lamp lightPostModern.glb every 34 offset 0.6 side left scale 8 along Via Giuseppe Massarenti
    dress cone cone.glb every 9 offset 0.4 scale 1.5 along Via Pietro Albertoni
    baskets every 430 first 230 across 4
    pad Viale Giambattista Ercolani 0.85
    pad Via Giuseppe Mazzini 0.35
    pad Policlinico Sant'Orsola-Malpighi 0.8
    hazard ambulance
    look sky 9fc8e8
    look ground c9b79a
    look palette c8553d d9a441 b5452f e0b36a cf7a52 a9432f e6c88e
    look start gantry
end
